      "en": "The LORD visited Sarah as he had said, and the LORD did to Sarah as he had spoken.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 그 말씀대로 사라를 권고하셨고 여호와께서 그 말씀대로 사라에게 행하셨으므로",
      "source_text_hash": "056ac9dfb28bc5e4afbc0933756ef20d737c457375eba8b2e3e3d6da62f2db88",
      "translation_text_hash": "dcf38fea819a291c37e85a7fdd8d164f37dfd677f4d74adea108dfbdef47a0c6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와께서 그 말씀대로 사라를 권고하셨고 여호와께서 그 말씀대로 사라에게 행하셨으므로"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "dcf38fea819a291c37e85a7fdd8d164f37dfd677f4d74adea108dfbdef47a0c6"
      ]
