      ],
      "en": "She said, “Who would have said to Abraham that Sarah would nurse children? For I have borne him a son in his old age.”",
      "ko": "또 가로되 사라가 자식들을 젖 먹이겠다고 누가 아브라함에게 말하였으리요 마는 아브라함 노경에 내가 아들을 낳았도다 하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "e2ab3ba10c4bd4b5d82f219583f22c844404d3a06711554886709e4e9fab3a53",
      "translation_text_hash": "705dc1f3820adc4647c842e57ba6d93c44e0d5d8513528f167b44aaff4011f5d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
