      "en": "The thing was very grievous in Abraham’s sight on account of his son.",
      "ko": "아브라함이 그 아들을 위하여 그 일이 깊이 근심이 되었더니",
      "source_text_hash": "f67fda7973800729647f21a92c96712a06e9c9bed61bd9532987ed0db513e0ac",
      "translation_text_hash": "d1a4e208b4d0195129b112b8f04dfcbcd8e7355dfea92772497c2809f5da8fef",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
